% holding-published: ontario-listening-bridges-2-big-drum-small-drum
% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been tried with children. A JK classroom trial, an early-years music teacher, a taiko-informed educator, a movement/accessibility reviewer and a second score reader must check the big/small answer in the silent bar 6, the gentle stomp, the loud/soft last BOOM and the way Kodo and taiko are introduced. The listening link is Kodo's own 16-second clip; a teacher may also want a longer official Kodo O-daiko performance.
